There are three ways to use the Logical OR 

 - Double brackets with Double pipes - using [[ condition1 || condition2 ]] is a way to evaluate multiple expressions.

 - Single Bracket with the [-o] flag -  you can use the [-o] inside a single square bracket.

 - Double bracket with seperated condition - the [ || ] is place between two seperate double bracket statements.


